---
/**
 * The bar on top of every page: the brand that leads home, the three sections drawn from the repositories
 * as the paths they answer at, the search over the challenges, the organization on GitHub and the theme
 * control. The section the reader is in is marked as the current page.
 */
import { SITE, TEXT } from '../content/site'
import BrandMark from './BrandMark.astro'
import Icon from './Icon.astro'
import ThemeToggle from './ThemeToggle.astro'

const sections = [
  { path: '/desafios/', label: 'desafios' },
  { path: '/vagas/', label: 'vagas' },
  { path: '/projetos/', label: 'projetos' },
]
const here = Astro.url.pathname
---

<header class="bb-bar">
  <div class="bb-wrap bb-bar__inner">
    <a href="/" class="bb-home" aria-label={TEXT.nav.homeLink}>
      <BrandMark />
    </a>
    <nav class="bb-nav" aria-label={TEXT.nav.label}>
      <ul>
        {
          sections.map((section) => (
            <li>
              <a href={section.path} aria-current={here.startsWith(section.path) ? 'page' : undefined}>
                <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
                {section.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <div class="bb-tools">
      <a href="/busca/" class="bb-tool" aria-label={TEXT.nav.search} title={TEXT.nav.search}>
        <Icon name="search" size={18} />
      </a>
      <a
        href={SITE.github}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="bb-tool"
        aria-label={TEXT.nav.github}
        title={TEXT.nav.github}
      >
        <Icon name="github" size={18} />
      </a>
      <ThemeToggle theme={TEXT.theme} />
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
